    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/a895997014ff062f90bf93512568bcbf.poster.avif?t=1753705848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/a895997014ff062f90bf93512568bcbf.webm?t=1753705848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/a895997014ff062f90bf93512568bcbf.mp4?t=1753705848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up after an untold amount of time, you find yourself in the decaying remains of a vast, lifeless facility. Set in a <i><strong>Blame!</strong></i><strong>-esque</strong> world, you must navigate the depths of an <strong>abandoned megastructure</strong>\u2014a seemingly endless structure of ruins and corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chained <strong>parkour </strong>movement, you traverse the crumbling infrastructure, exploring a desolate world long forgotten. But there is no one left to witness it but the massive iron structure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/0ea644f3c12303a221f4c3ea2ee9d724.avif?t=1753705848\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &amp; traverse the vastness of the\u00a0<strong>Megastructure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through spaces as small as ventilation shafts to giant rooms of which you cant even see the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the past and piece together the mysterious <strong>lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic\u00a0<strong>parkour</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Wallrun and Dash through the game...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... or take it slow and enjoy the view </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/a895997014ff062f90bf93512568bcbf.poster.avif?t=1753705848\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/a895997014ff062f90bf93512568bcbf.webm?t=1753705848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/a895997014ff062f90bf93512568bcbf.mp4?t=1753705848\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up after an untold amount of time, you find yourself in the decaying remains of a vast, lifeless facility. Set in a <i><strong>Blame!</strong></i><strong>-esque</strong> world, you must navigate the depths of an <strong>abandoned megastructure</strong>\u2014a seemingly endless structure of ruins and corridors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through chained <strong>parkour </strong>movement, you traverse the crumbling infrastructure, exploring a desolate world long forgotten. But there is no one left to witness it but the massive iron structure.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547010/extras/0ea644f3c12303a221f4c3ea2ee9d724.avif?t=1753705848\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore &amp; traverse the vastness of the\u00a0<strong>Megastructure</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way through spaces as small as ventilation shafts to giant rooms of which you cant even see the end</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the past and piece together the mysterious <strong>lore</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine classic\u00a0<strong>parkour</strong> with <strong>environmental puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, Wallrun and Dash through the game...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... or take it slow and enjoy the view </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mik is an atmospheric, narrative-driven platformer, set in a post-apocalyptic world. What was once a thriving megastructure is now a rotting corpse of a facility, where you find yourself exploring fragments of the past.",
